# Beacon Component

Beacon chain node client wrapper that manages service lifecycle and readiness coordination.

## Key Integration Pattern
- Wraps ethpandaops/beacon client with custom service orchestration
- Service-based architecture with dependency management via OnReady callbacks
- Synchronization state validation before marking node as usable

## Important Constraints
- Services must be started sequentially with readiness checks
- Node sync distance must be ≤3 slots and within 64 slots of wallclock